<opsproc code="00020452.0001001" revdate="2016-11-22T19:14:29"><title>Right Aileron Blue Servo-Control (Controlled by ELAC 2)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00020452.0001001.001"><title>During engine start</title><procbody lid="N.00020452.0001001.002"><action-block lid="N.00020452.0001001.003"><action layer="1" lid="N.00020452.0001001.004" memory="false"><command code="00020452.0001001.001"><para layer="1" lid="N.00020452.0001001.005">The <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>F/CTL ELAC2 FAULT</ecamsys></ecam-data> alert may be/is displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb> after the first
